* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* RMONITOR - Monitor Loop
*
* Maintenance:
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ....
* mrs 93-01-28 s(182359) old version saved, monitor won't close
* mrs 93-12-03 s(999999) make event-name unique to allow multiple NOMs
*                        under one ESY
* mrs 93-12-10 s(999999) use common data to reduce data base calls
* mrs 94-02-06 s(999999) JES3 inplemented
* mrs 94-03-01 s(999999) BS2 inplemented
* mrs 94-05-16 s(999999) check NPR-USERID before each function
* gw  94-06-22 s(999999) CMASPOOL implemented
* gw  94-11-17 s(999999) SAP-Spool implemented
* gw  94-11-29 s(999999) USR-Spool implemented
* gw  95-01-09 s(999999) AIV for printertasks
* gw  95-01-17 p(136151) AIV for printertasks
* mrs 95-11-01 s(999999) NOM135 process count and rename orders
* gw  98-02-17 s(275206) synchronize report creation with source cleanup
*                        -> RMARCSCH, NOMCLEAN, RMSRCK, NOMCLNSP
* gw  98-06-12 p(171538) Calendar in cleanup schedule always 'CLEAN'
* jvd 98-08-19 s(164220) NOM141 - NAT23 changes
* xsisaa 99-07-05 s(259992) CE7187 / remove comments pre 1996
* fhi 00-01-27 s(191368) version taken from NOM142 and stowed for NOM211
* sju 00-02-28 p(192484) No printing during cleanup
* sju 00-03-13 s(191368) monitor multitasking
* sju 00-03-14 p(192484) no printing during cleanup - see NOMCLEAN
* fhi 00-08-22 QA01      Use Natural RDC utility and display statistics
* fhi 05-11-15 P272724   End Transaction for Unix Eventing necessary
*
* User Id yyyy-mm-ss Mark       Comment
* ------- ---------- ---------  ----------------------------------------
* fhi     2000-09-12 s(196560)  Add Unix File Support
* sju   02-12-17 p(230197) Monitor hangs while system defaults are being
*                        modified (8.1.1/8.1.2/8.1.3/8.1.4). Use a new
*                        control record SYNCHCLN.
* sju     2003-10-22  p(246164) NPR 3.2 and JES3
* sju     2004-07-15 NOM31     Dynamic tracing
* sju   04-12-06 NOM31     Add date and time (tenths of second) to trace
* sju     2005-03-16 NOM31     NAT AM=NOM
* fhi     2005-06-23 p(266530) Monitor must be NPR Mainframe independent
* xsetggr 2007-05-07 NOM3201  Support 5 byte node numbers
* fhi     2007-07-12 NOM3204  More detailed message at monitor abend.
* xsetggr 2007-10-31 NRT1560  operator commannd to check monitor status
* fhi     2007-11-01 p298580  Not all files fetched from Unix directory
* fhi     2008-03-03 NRT1560  out 2007-10-31, to be handled different
* fhi     2008-05-13 P303573  Delete duplicate steplib entries
* fhi     2010-05-31 NOMALL-93 Create statistics data for Optimize
* fhi     2010-06-16 NOMALL-93 Create statistics data for Optimize
* fhi     2010-08-04 NOMALL-93 Create statistics data for Optimize
* fhi     2010-08-27 NOMALL-838 Add trace statements
* fhi     2010-08-30 NOMALL-838 Supply the correct SPOOL-TYPE
* fhi     2010-09-03 NOMALL-97 Call RMRDCDSP with correct trace variable
* fhi     2010-09-10 NOMALL-93 Create statistics data for Optimize
*                              Make work around for NATMF-16454 (#TXT)
* fhi     2010-09-21 NOMALL-800 Backout P298580, other reasons
* fhi     2010-10-05 NOMALL-97  extend trace levels
* fhi     2010-10-08 NOMALL-97 Use dynamic memory handling
* fhi     2010-10-12 NOMALL-97 Use trace levels, use XXRLOG
* fhi     2010-11-05 NOMALL-97 Correct calling of Unix Scan Module
* fhi     2010-11-11 NOMALL-97 Correct error handling
* fhi     2011-02-11 NOMALL-929 Avoid NAT3009 subcode 6
* fhi     2011-03-02 NOMALL-947 Do not go idle if cycle was not idle
* fhi     2011-03-15 NOMALL-947 Introduce 10 nowait cycles
* fhi     2011-06-07 NOMALL-77 Introduce wrap around trace
* fhi     2011-10-05 NOMALL-1019 Backout NOMALL-947 for mainframes
* splildav 2011-10-27 NOMALL-1060 Display CPU usage of monitor cycle
* fhi      2012-08-29 NOMALL-1195 Avoid too many Adabas calls
* fhi      2013-07-01 NOMALL-86   Introduce export utility
* fhi      2013-07-17 NOMALL-975  Wake monitor --> reset idle time
* SU1 2014-02-10 NOMALL-1344 unix - daily cleanup does not delete orders
* fhi     2014-03-03 NOMALL-1363 Get cat cate into trace messages
* fhi     2014-09-11 NOMALL-1480 Abort monitor if wrong NPR version
* SU2     2014-11-12 NOMALL-1527 get rid of coding for old versions
* fhi     2016-08-15 NOMALL-1621 Introduce Multinode Feature
* fhi     2016-09-08 NOMALL-1621 same
* fhi     2016-09-15 NOMALL-1621 Use LOCAL-NODE.M-MONITOR-NODE
* fhi     2016-10-18 NOMALL-1934 Correct Error TA handling
* fhi     2016-10-19 NOMALL-1934 Add RMEMAIL to monitor cyle
* fhi     2016-10-28 NOMALL-1934 Add RMREACT to monitor cyle
* fhi     2016-11-03 NOMALL-1621 ESY Logon only in RMSWNODE
* fhi     2016-11-15 NOMALL-1961 Use new task IDs, no tags
* fhi     2016-12-14 NOMALL-1921 Add status 'Monitor working'
* fhi     2017-01-05 NOMALL-1961 Avoid NAT1257
* fhi     2017-01-06 NOMALL-1621 Call RDCDISIO, too.
* fhi     2017-01-11 NOMALL-1961 Change descriptor of NRM-ORDER
* fhi     2017-02-09 NOMALL-1961 Add trace messages
* fhi     2017-02-10 NOMALL-1961 Correct task handling
* SU3     2017-03-02 NOM3.5      remove RGETLIB
* fhi     2017-03-23 NOMALL-2008 Add CAT Natural Source by monitor
* fhi     2017-03-29 NOMALL-2008 Improve traces
* fhi     2017-03-31 NOMALL-2009 Improve RDC handling
* fhi/bli 2017-04-25 NOMALL-1871 NAT1257 if error in NOMSTCS
* fhi     2017-05-02 NOMALL-1917 scan correct spool-queues
* fhi     2017-11-07 NOMALL-2047 Ensure each cycle that WH=ON
* SU4     2018-01-11 NOMALL-1823 NOM 3.5: remove SAP
* fhi     2018-02-13 NOMALL-1918 Regard Unix, no tags
* fhi     2018-04-25 NOM 3.5     NOSTATISTICS -> STATISTICS=ON
* SU5     2018-10-18             LDA MONITNGL removed
* fhi     2018-04-25 NOMALL-1905 Do not call statistics if +O4I false
* fhi     2018-12-14 NOM 3.5     Improve CPU measures, no tags
* fhi     2018-12-18 NOMALL-1770 Export tasks not processed
* BLI     2019-06-17 NOMALL-2274 Wrong NPR version
* SU6     2020-07-27 NOMALL-2327 unix:check license key/expiration date
* SU7     2021-04-16 NOMALL-2454 recat RMTASK-P to avoid NAT1305
* BLI     2021-10-08 NOMALL-2498 wrong call of RMCHKDWN, move RMSWNODE
* BLI1    2023-09-29 NOMALL-2636 Cleanup on remote nodes
* SU8     2024-03-07 ES-34613    NOM 3.6 Remove power / BS2
* NKEW1   2024-04-25 ES-35215    NOM 3.6 Licence check mainframe
* SU9     2024-09-02 ES-35716    deactivate O4I
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA GLOBAL USING MONIT-GL
*
INDEPENDENT
1 +NOD-CURRENT-NODE          (N5)
1 +NOD-CURRENT-ID            (A20)
1 +NOD-LOCAL-NODE            (N5)
1 +NOD-LOCAL-ID              (A20)
1 +NOD-CURRENT-SPOOL-TYPE    (A8)
1 +CMRDC                     (A1)
1 +ERROR-COUNT-UX            (I2)
1 +NOWAIT                    (I2)
/*SU9 1 +O4I                       (L)
* *****
LOCAL USING RMSETSTE
LOCAL USING RLOG-L
LOCAL USING RMTASK-E
LOCAL USING NOMSTCSP
LOCAL USING RMTASK-P
LOCAL
1 MONITOR VIEW OF NRM-MONITOR
  2 M-WAIT-CURRENT
  2 M-MONITOR-TASKS
  2 REDEFINE M-MONITOR-TASKS
    3 M-SPOOL-QUEUE          (N3)
    3 M-COPY-SOURCE          (N3)
    3 M-CREATE-REPORTS       (N3)
    3 M-MANAGE-PRINTOUTS     (N3)
1 CPU VIEW OF SYSTEM-INFO
  2 CPU-UTILIZATION
1 ORDERS VIEW OF NRM-ORDER
1 CLEANUP-TASK VIEW OF NRM-ARCHIVE-TASK
  2 M-ARCHIVE-PREFIX
  2 REDEFINE M-ARCHIVE-PREFIX
    3 CLEANUP-IDENTIFIER     (A5)
    3 CLEANUP-RESCHEDULE     (L)
    3 CLEANUP-ACTIVE-NOW     (L)
    3 REPORT-PROCESSING-NOW  (L)
1 #I                         (I2)
1 #TXT                       (A70) /* only if zap Nat427/NA76130 missing
/*                                    work around for NATMF-16454
1 #MON-ID                    (A5)  INIT <'NOM0x'>
/* Please take note if you change the NAME of subtask then you
/* must also make changes to RHANMO and RHANMON and Eventing progs
/* Also please remember that NPR uses SUB-TASK name for
/* eventing, so if you make a change here NPR must know
/* about this change, this value is hard coded in NPR ???
/*
1 #EVENT-NAME                (A8)
1 REDEFINE #EVENT-NAME
  2 #EVENT-PREFIX            (A4)
  2 #EVENT-DBID              (B2)
  2 #EVENT-FNR               (B2)
1 #REPORT-PROCESSING-NOW     (L)
1 #EVENT-MESSAGE             (A250)
1 NAT00009-PARMS
  2 NAT00009-FUNCTION        (B1)
  2 NAT00009-RESPONSE        (N4)
  2 NAT00009-NUMBER-ACTIVE   (I2)
  2 NAT00009-CURRENT-INDEX   (I2)
  2 NAT00009-APPLIC          (A8)
  2 NAT00009-LIBRARY         (A8)
  2 NAT00009-DBID            (B2)
  2 NAT00009-FNR             (B2)
  2 NAT00009-PASSWORD        (A8)
  2 NAT00009-CIPHER          (N8)
  2 NAT00009-DIS-EN          (A1)
  2 NAT00009-SYSIND          (A1)
  2 NAT00009-POSITION        (I2)
  2 NAT00009-NUMBER-MODULES  (I2)
  2 NAT00009-RESERVE         (B32)
  2 NAT00009-MODULES         (A80)
1 #S                         (P9)
1 RMSETTIM
  2 FUNCTION                 (A1)
  2 ERC                      (N4)
  2 MSG                      (A250)
  2 TIME                     (I4)
1 #OD-FROM-G
  2 TYPE                     (B2)
  2 TIME-SCHEDULED           (P13)
1 REDEFINE #OD-FROM-G
  2 #OD-FROM                 (A9)
1 #OD-TO-G
  2  TYPE                    (B2) INIT <5000>
  2  TIME-SCHEDULED          (P13)
1 REDEFINE #OD-TO-G
  2 #OD-TO                   (A9)
1 #TRACING                   (L)
1 #MONITOR-STATUS            (A1)
1 #MONITOR-TIME              (T)
1 #TASK-NUMBER               (N3)
1 #TASKS-IDLE                (L)
1 #MAX-TASKS                 (I1) CONST <59>
1 #CATDATE                   (A19)
1 #LINE                      (I4)
1 #STATISTICS-ERROR          (L)
1 #NAT51002 /*SU6
  2 PROD-NAME                (A253) INIT <'Entire Output Management'>
  2 PROD-VERSION             (A253) INIT <'3.5'> /*SU8 was 3.5
  2 LICENSE-FILE-NAME        (A)    DYNAMIC
  2 SHOW-MESSAGE             (L)
  2 LC-ERC                   (I4)
  2 LC-ERT                   (A253) /*OPT
  2 EXP-LIMIT                (I4)   INIT <30> /*OPT 30 is default
  2 EXP-DAYS                 (I4)   /*OPT
1 #MF                        (L)
1 #NAT82003 /*NKEW1
  2 PRODUCT-VERSION          (A8)   INIT <'3.5'>
  2 MSGS                     (A78/10)
1 #DATE                      (D) /*NKEW1
1 #MSG-PREFIX                 (A20) /*NKEW1
1 #MSG-LONG                   (A254)/*NKEW1
1 #M-STARTED                 (L) INIT <FALSE> /* Monitor started bool
*
END-DEFINE
*
************************************************************************
* Main line
************************************************************************
*
CALLNAT 'NOMGSTEP' '*' G-NATRP-ERC
*ERROR-TA := 'RM-ERRTA'
PERFORM XXCATAL-GET-CATDATE #CATDATE
COMPRESS *PROGRAM 'cataloged at'  #CATDATE TO G-TRACE-MSG
PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
RMSETTIM.FUNCTION := 'R'
PERFORM RMSETTIM-SETTIME RMSETTIM
IF *MACHINE-CLASS = 'MAINFRAME'
  #MF := TRUE
END-IF
*/*NKEW commented section
* IF (*MACHINE-CLASS = 'PC' OR = 'UNIX') AND G-TASK-NUMBER = 1 /*SU6
*  PERFORM CHECK-LICENCE
* END-IF
*
CYCLE. REPEAT
* Check Licence on LUW and Mainframe daily
  IF G-TASK-NUMBER = 1 AND #DATE < *DATX /*NKEW>>
    #DATE := *DATX
    IF (*MACHINE-CLASS = 'PC' OR = 'UNIX')
      PERFORM CHECK-LICENCE
    END-IF
    IF (#MF)
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'W' '*************************'
      PERFORM CHECK-LICENCE-MF
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'W' '*************************'
    END-IF
  END-IF /*NKEW<<
  RMSETTIM.FUNCTION := 'S'
  PERFORM RMSETTIM-SETTIME RMSETTIM
  PERFORM RMGTRACE-GET-SETTINGS #TRACING
  PERFORM XXPARAMS-SET-PARAM 'WH=ON'
  FETCH RETURN 'RMCHKDWN' /* Check Monitor termination
  IF #TRACING
    COMPRESS 'Schedule condition in line ' *LINE 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER
      'Table' G-TASK-TABLE(EQU-MANAGE-PRINTOUTS) 'Manage printouts'
      'RMCTNAT' TO G-TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
    END TRANSACTION
  END-IF
* Check first of all if there is a CAT to be done:
  IF NOT G-SHUTDOWN AND G-TASK-NUMBER=G-TASK-TABLE(EQU-MANAGE-PRINTOUTS)
    FETCH RETURN 'RMCTNAT'
    FETCH RETURN 'RMCTMSG'  /* Handle messages of RMCTNAT
  END-IF
  IF #TRACING AND NOT G-SHUTDOWN
    G-TRACE-MSG := '*******************'
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
    G-TRACE-MSG := 'Start monitor cycle'
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
    G-TRACE-MSG := '*******************'
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
  END-IF
  INCLUDE CMRDC
  CALLNAT 'RMSETSTN' #EQU-START-CYCLE +NOD-LOCAL-NODE G-NATRP-DBID
    G-NATRP-FNR G-SHUTDOWN G-TASK-NUMBER
  END TRANSACTION
  RESET +ERROR-COUNT-UX
  PERFORM CLEANUP-STEPLIBS           /* P303573 in
  IF #TRACING AND G-NATRP-ERC NE 0       /* BLI NOMALL-2498 add log
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-NATRP-ERT
    END TRANSACTION
  END-IF
  CALLNAT 'RMNPRUSR' G-MONITOR-NODE G-NPR-USERID
    G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT #TRACING
  G-NPR-CURRENT-USERID := G-NPR-USERID
  END TRANSACTION /* Commit open transactions to avoid record in hold
  IF G-NATRP-ERC NE 0
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'W' G-NATRP-ERT
    END TRANSACTION
    IF +NOD-CURRENT-ID = +NOD-LOCAL-ID
      G-SHUTDOWN:= TRUE
      FETCH 'RMCHKDWN'
    END-IF
    RESET G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT        /* BLI NOMALL-2498
    ESCAPE TOP
  END-IF
  CALLNAT 'RMSWNODE' 'N'  /* switch to next MF node  /* BLI NOMALL-2498
    G-TASK-NUMBER G-NATRP-DBID G-NATRP-FNR #TRACING
  END TRANSACTION
  IF #TRACING AND #MF
    FIND CPU WITH NODE = +NOD-CURRENT-NODE
      COMPRESS '% CPU utilization of node' +NOD-CURRENT-NODE
        '-->' CPU-UTILIZATION TO  G-TRACE-MSG
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
    END-FIND
  END-IF
  IF NOT G-SHUTDOWN
    FETCH RETURN 'RMBPPG' /* process purge bpm orders
  END-IF
  IF NOT G-SHUTDOWN
    #LINE := *LINE
    CALLNAT 'RMSETSTN' #EQU-MONITOR +NOD-LOCAL-NODE G-NATRP-DBID
      G-NATRP-FNR G-SHUTDOWN G-TASK-NUMBER 1X #LINE
    END TRANSACTION
  END-IF
*
  DECIDE FOR EVERY CONDITION
    WHEN #TRACING AND NOT G-SHUTDOWN
      COMPRESS 'Schedule condition in line ' *LINE 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER
        'Table' G-TASK-TABLE(EQU-CREATE-REPORTS) 'Create reports'
        'PERFORM UPDATE-CLEANUP-DEFAULTS' TO G-TRACE-MSG
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      END TRANSACTION
    WHEN NOT G-SHUTDOWN
    AND G-TASK-NUMBER = G-TASK-TABLE(EQU-CREATE-REPORTS)              /*
      #REPORT-PROCESSING-NOW := TRUE
      PERFORM UPDATE-CLEANUP-DEFAULTS
*
    WHEN #TRACING AND NOT G-SHUTDOWN
      COMPRESS 'Schedule condition in line ' *LINE 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER
        'Table' G-TASK-TABLE(EQU-SPOOL-QUEUE) 'Spool Queue'
        'PERFORM SCAN-SPOOL-QUEUE' TO G-TRACE-MSG
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      END TRANSACTION
    WHEN NOT G-SHUTDOWN AND G-TASK-NUMBER =G-TASK-TABLE(EQU-SPOOL-QUEUE)
      PERFORM SCAN-SPOOL-QUEUE
*
    WHEN #TRACING AND NOT G-SHUTDOWN
      COMPRESS 'Schedule condition in line ' *LINE 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER
        'Table' G-TASK-TABLE (EQU-CP-SRCE-BEGIN:EQU-CP-SRCE-END)
        'Copy Source PERFORM COPY-SOURCE-TO-DB' TO G-TRACE-MSG
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      END TRANSACTION
    WHEN NOT G-SHUTDOWN
    AND G-TASK-NUMBER = G-TASK-TABLE (EQU-CP-SRCE-BEGIN:EQU-CP-SRCE-END)
      PERFORM COPY-SOURCE-TO-DB
    WHEN #TRACING AND NOT G-SHUTDOWN
      COMPRESS 'Schedule condition in line ' *LINE 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER
        'Table' G-TASK-TABLE (EQU-CREATE-REPORTS)
        'Create reports PERFORM CREATE-REPORTS-BUNDLES' TO G-TRACE-MSG
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      END TRANSACTION
    WHEN NOT G-SHUTDOWN
    AND G-TASK-NUMBER = G-TASK-TABLE(EQU-CREATE-REPORTS)              /*
      PERFORM CREATE-REPORTS-BUNDLES
      #REPORT-PROCESSING-NOW := FALSE
      PERFORM UPDATE-CLEANUP-DEFAULTS
      PERFORM POST-CLEANUP-TASK
    WHEN NOT G-SHUTDOWN AND G-TASK-NUMBER LE 1 /* BLI1 moved from below
      PERFORM DELETE-SOURCES                   /* BLI1
************************************************************************
    WHEN +NOD-CURRENT-ID NE +NOD-LOCAL-ID  /* it's a remote node
      IF #TRACING
        COMPRESS 'Remote node:' 'Current ID:' +NOD-CURRENT-ID
          'LOCAL NODE:' +NOD-LOCAL-ID
          'Cycle stops here and restarts.' TO G-TRACE-MSG
        PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
        END TRANSACTION
      END-IF
      ESCAPE TOP /* <<<<< next cycle >>>>>
************************************************************************
    WHEN #TRACING AND NOT G-SHUTDOWN
      COMPRESS 'Schedule condition in line ' *LINE 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER
        'Table' G-TASK-TABLE (EQU-MANAGE-PRINTOUTS)
        'Manage printouts PERFORM FOLLOW-PRINT-JOBS' TO G-TRACE-MSG
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      END TRANSACTION
    WHEN NOT G-SHUTDOWN
    AND G-TASK-NUMBER = G-TASK-TABLE(EQU-MANAGE-PRINTOUTS)            /*
      PERFORM FOLLOW-PRINT-JOBS
*
    WHEN #TRACING AND NOT G-SHUTDOWN
      COMPRESS 'Schedule condition in line ' *LINE 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER
        'Table' G-TASK-TABLE (EQU-MANAGE-PRINTOUTS)
        'Manage printouts PERFORM FOLLOW-PRINT-TASKS' TO G-TRACE-MSG
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      END TRANSACTION
    WHEN NOT G-SHUTDOWN
    AND G-TASK-NUMBER = G-TASK-TABLE(EQU-MANAGE-PRINTOUTS)            /*
      PERFORM FOLLOW-PRINT-TASKS
*
    WHEN #TRACING AND NOT G-SHUTDOWN
      COMPRESS 'Schedule condition in line ' *LINE 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER
        'Table' G-TASK-TABLE (EQU-MANAGE-PRINTOUTS)
        'Manage printouts PERFORM SCAN-PRINTOUT-QUEUE' TO G-TRACE-MSG
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      END TRANSACTION
    WHEN NOT G-SHUTDOWN
    AND G-TASK-NUMBER = G-TASK-TABLE(EQU-MANAGE-PRINTOUTS)            /*
      PERFORM SCAN-PRINTOUT-QUEUE
*
/*SU8 -> WHEN NOT G-SHUTDOWN
/*                AND G-TASK-NUMBER = G-TASK-TABLE(EQU-MANAGE-PRINTOUTS)
/* IF SYSTEM-INFO-VIEW.SPOOL-TYPE = 'POWR'
/* or SYSTEM-INFO-VIEW.SYSTEM-TYPE = SCAN 'BS2'
/*SU8 <-  PERFORM FOLLOW-PRINT-JOBS END-IF
    WHEN NOT G-SHUTDOWN
    AND G-TASK-NUMBER = G-TASK-TABLE(EQU-MANAGE-PRINTOUTS)            /*
      PERFORM FOLLOW-PRINT-TASKS
*
**  WHEN NOT G-SHUTDOWN AND G-TASK-NUMBER LE 1 BLI1 move above
**    PERFORM DELETE-SOURCES                   BLI1
    WHEN NOT G-SHUTDOWN AND G-TASK-NUMBER LE 1
      #TASKS-IDLE := TRUE
      FORTSKS. FOR #TASK-NUMBER := 21 TO #MAX-TASKS
        CALLNAT 'RMGETSTN' #MONITOR-STATUS #MONITOR-TIME +NOD-LOCAL-NODE
          G-NATRP-DBID G-NATRP-FNR #TASK-NUMBER 2X #TRACING
        DECIDE ON FIRST VALUE OF #MONITOR-STATUS
          VALUES ' ','C','D',#EQU-NOTACTIVE,#EQU-ENDED,
              #EQU-CLOSED,#EQU-ABENDED, #EQU-SHUTDOWN
            IGNORE
          NONE VALUE
            #TASKS-IDLE := FALSE
            ESCAPE BOTTOM (FORTSKS.)
        END-DECIDE
      END-FOR
      #TASK-NUMBER := 1
      CALLNAT 'RMSETSTN' #EQU-EXPORT +NOD-LOCAL-NODE G-NATRP-DBID
        G-NATRP-FNR G-SHUTDOWN #TASK-NUMBER
      END TRANSACTION
      FETCH RETURN 'RMEXPORT'
      IF NOT G-SHUTDOWN
        #LINE := *LINE
        CALLNAT 'RMSETSTN' #EQU-MONITOR +NOD-LOCAL-NODE G-NATRP-DBID
          G-NATRP-FNR G-SHUTDOWN #TASK-NUMBER 1X #LINE
        END TRANSACTION
      END-IF
    WHEN NONE
      IGNORE
  END-DECIDE
*
  IF #TRACING
    COMPRESS 'Schedule condition in line ' *LINE 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER
      'Table' G-TASK-TABLE (EQU-CREATE-REPORTS)
      'Create reports FETCH RETURN ''RMRSETRP''' TO G-TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
    END TRANSACTION
  END-IF
  IF G-TASK-NUMBER = G-TASK-TABLE(EQU-CREATE-REPORTS)
    FETCH RETURN 'RMRSETRP'  /* Reset an uncomlished report
  END-IF
  FETCH RETURN 'RMPRGTRC'  /* Delete wrap around trace information
  END TRANSACTION          /* with status = 'O'
*
  IF NOT G-SHUTDOWN AND G-TASK-NUMBER LE 1
    CALLNAT 'RMSETSTN' #EQU-EMAIL +NOD-LOCAL-NODE G-NATRP-DBID
      G-NATRP-FNR G-SHUTDOWN G-TASK-NUMBER
    END TRANSACTION
    FETCH RETURN 'RMEMAIL' /* Check for emails to be sent
    IF NOT G-SHUTDOWN
      #LINE := *LINE
      CALLNAT 'RMSETSTN' #EQU-MONITOR +NOD-LOCAL-NODE G-NATRP-DBID
        G-NATRP-FNR G-SHUTDOWN G-TASK-NUMBER 1X #LINE
      END TRANSACTION
    END-IF
  END-IF
  IF NOT G-SHUTDOWN AND G-TASK-NUMBER LE 1
    CALLNAT 'RMSETSTN' #EQU-REACT +NOD-LOCAL-NODE G-NATRP-DBID
      G-NATRP-FNR G-SHUTDOWN G-TASK-NUMBER
    END TRANSACTION
    FETCH RETURN 'RMREACT' /* Try to reactivate suspended MF nodes
    IF NOT G-SHUTDOWN
      #LINE := *LINE
      CALLNAT 'RMSETSTN' #EQU-MONITOR +NOD-LOCAL-NODE G-NATRP-DBID
        G-NATRP-FNR G-SHUTDOWN G-TASK-NUMBER 1X #LINE
      END TRANSACTION
    END-IF
  END-IF
*
/*SU9  IF +O4I PERFORM WRITE-STATISTICS END-IF
*
  RMSETTIM.FUNCTION := 'G'
  PERFORM RMSETTIM-SETTIME RMSETTIM
*
  RESET G-ERR-GROUP
  IF #TRACING
    G-TRACE-MSG := '******************'
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
    COMPRESS 'End of monitor cycle.'
      TO G-TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
    G-TRACE-MSG := RMSETTIM.MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
    G-TRACE-MSG := '******************'
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
  END-IF
  IF NOT G-SHUTDOWN
    PERFORM WAIT-FOR-NEXT-CYCLE
  END-IF
END-REPEAT
*
************************************************************************
* End of main line (now subroutines):
************************************************************************
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE SCAN-SPOOL-QUEUE
************************************************************************
CALLNAT 'RMNPRUSR' G-MONITOR-NODE G-NPR-USERID
  G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT #TRACING
G-NPR-CURRENT-USERID := G-NPR-USERID
/*SU8  IF SYSTEM-INFO-VIEW.SYSTEM-TYPE = SCAN ('BS2')
/*SU8  SYSTEM-INFO-VIEW.SPOOL-TYPE :=SYSTEM-INFO-VIEW.SYSTEM-TYPE END-IF
/* Indicate current status of monitor cycle:
CALLNAT 'RMSETSTN' #EQU-SCANJES +NOD-LOCAL-NODE G-NATRP-DBID G-NATRP-FNR
  G-SHUTDOWN G-TASK-NUMBER
END TRANSACTION
IF G-SHUTDOWN
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
*
IF G-SCAN-CMASPOOL = 'Y'
  FETCH RETURN 'RMSCCMA' /*Scan CMASPOOL Queue+Create Source+Orders
END-IF
IF G-SCAN-NOMUSR (*) = 'Y'
  FETCH RETURN 'RMSCUSR' /*Scan NOMPUT Q for USRSPOOLnn+create orders
END-IF
*
DECIDE ON FIRST +NOD-CURRENT-SPOOL-TYPE
/*SU8  VALUE 'POWR' FETCH RETURN 'RMSCPWR'
  VALUE 'JES2'
    FETCH RETURN 'RMSCJES2'
  VALUE 'JES3'
    FETCH RETURN 'RMSCJE32'
  VALUE 'SPOOL' /* BS2000
    FETCH RETURN 'RMSCBS2' /*Scan BS2 Queue and Create Source and Orders
    FETCH RETURN 'RMB2RNC' /*process COUNT+RENAME orders(BS2-specific)
  VALUE 'UNIX'
    IGNORE /* do it below (see #UNIX#)
  NONE VALUE
    G-NATRP-ERC := 4501
    COMPRESS '-->' +NOD-CURRENT-SPOOL-TYPE '<--'
      TO G-NATRP-ERT LEAVING NO
    COMPRESS G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT TO G-NATRP-ERT
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'W' G-NATRP-ERT
    G-SHUTDOWN:= TRUE
    END TRANSACTION
    ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-DECIDE
*
END TRANSACTION
*
IF G-NP-ENTRIES > 0 OR G-SCAN-TRIGGER = 'Y' /* NAT AM=NOM
  FETCH RETURN 'RMSCNP' /*Scan NOMPUT Queue+Create Source and Orders:
END-IF
* Scan Unix Files on external nodes (#UNIX#):
IF G-SCAN-UNIX = 'Y' AND +NOD-CURRENT-ID = +NOD-LOCAL-ID
  CALLNAT 'RMSETSTN' #EQU-ANALYSE-UNIX +NOD-LOCAL-NODE
    G-NATRP-DBID G-NATRP-FNR G-SHUTDOWN G-TASK-NUMBER
  END TRANSACTION
  FETCH RETURN 'RMSCUX'
* BLI 2019-06-17 NOMALL-2274 Don't handle wrong NPR version here.
**IF G-NATRP-ERC = 1581 AND *MACHINE-CLASS NE 'MAINFRAME'
**  G-SHUTDOWN := TRUE
**  G-TRACE-MSG := G-NATRP-ERT
**  MOVE LEFT G-TRACE-MSG TO G-TRACE-MSG
**  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'W' G-TRACE-MSG
**  G-TRACE-MSG := '1575' /* Monitor shutdown due to severe error
**  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'W' G-TRACE-MSG
**  END TRANSACTION
**  ESCAPE ROUTINE
**END-IF
END-IF
IF NOT G-SHUTDOWN
  #LINE := *LINE
  CALLNAT 'RMSETSTN' #EQU-MONITOR +NOD-LOCAL-NODE G-NATRP-DBID
    G-NATRP-FNR G-SHUTDOWN G-TASK-NUMBER 1X #LINE
  END TRANSACTION
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE  /* SCAN-SPOOL-QUEUE
*
************************************************************************
